## @deepseek-ai/dsh-compaction-basic v0.1.5-rc.2 (commit fb2c4b9e69)

Copyright (c) 2026 DeepSeek
MIT License — https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness

The transactional region replacement in `lib/compact-core.js`
(`compactSurfaceRegion` and the helpers it calls) is dsh-compact-saviour's
adaptation of that package. It is carried through unchanged because the
controller must produce the exact same compaction marker triple, surface op and
stability checks as the official engine — a reimplementation would drift.

